   "definition_quote": "At each round $t \\in [T]$, the sender commits to a signaling scheme $\\phi_t : \\Theta \\to \\Delta_\\sset$ and observes a state of nature $\\theta^t \\sim \\mu$. Then, they draw a signal $s^t \\sim \\phi_{t, \\theta^t}$ and send it to the receiver, who plays a best-response action $a^t \\coloneqq a^{\\phi_t}(s^t)$. ... $R_T \\coloneqq T \\cdot \\text{OPT} - \\mathbb{E}[\\sum_{t=1}^T u^\\text{s} ( \\phi_t )]$"
